{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26944","headline":"和郑相演杨尚书蜀中唱和诗 · 姚合","name":"和郑相演杨尚书蜀中唱和诗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"天福坤维厚，忠贤拥节旄。\n江同渭滨远，山似傅岩高。\n元气符才格，文星照笔毫。\n五言全丽则，六义出风骚。\n圣日麻双下，洪炉柄共操。\n宠荣连雨露，先後比萧曹。\n唱绝时难和，吟多客讵劳。\n四方虽纸贵，谁怕费钱刀。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"姚合","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_26944.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26944","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}